# =============================================================================
# YouPeak monorepo - one folder per app, each deployed on its own
#   landing/        Vite + React landing site         (Vercel: landing)
#   admin-panel/    React admin panel                 (Vercel: admin)
#   functions/      Express API + Firebase Functions  (Vercel: api)
#   flutter/        Flutter consumer app              (built locally)
#   tools/          local-dev stack, DB import data, fingerprint worker
#   scripts/        build and deploy helpers
#   docs/           reports, notes, design material
#   archive/        old local files, never used by the apps
# Each app keeps its own .gitignore as well; this file is the safety net.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Secrets & credentials (never commit) -----------------------------------
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
serviceAccountKey.json
**/serviceAccountKey.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
